      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "> Is it possible that a social networking service shows that your friends are in a group instance, but you can't actually join that instance?\n\nyes that is possible to happen that you can see your friend, but not join. this is depending on the Group Role permissions. If you try to join you will see a 403 error.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
